%description:
A base station has one background traffic generator per carrier: its NIC's numCarriers sizes
bgTrafficGenerator[], and the MAC gives each carrier the generator of its position. A gNB on two
carriers with numCarriers left at its default of 1 crashed on the missing second generator. A
number of generators other than the number of carriers is an error at initialization.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.carrierAggregation.numComponentCarriers = 2
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].carrierFrequency = 2GHz
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1].carrierFrequency = 3.5GHz
*.gnb.cellularNic.phy.componentCarrierModules = "carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0] carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1]"
*.ue[*].cellularNic.nrPhy.componentCarrierModules = "carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0] carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1]"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
the cell has 2 carriers (phy.componentCarrierModules) but 1 background traffic generators: set the NIC's numCarriers to the number of carriers
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
